{"seq":3,"slug":"im-triggered-automation","title":"IM 触发自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/im-triggered-automation","wordCount":1219,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"im-触发自动化\">IM 触发自动化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Cron 是 agent 自动触发，IM 触发是用户主动输入命令——本质都是把 inbound event 接到同一 transform 管线。&quot;在飞书发 <code>/deploy staging</code>&quot; 比&quot;打开 CI 网页点 deploy 按钮&quot;快两个数量级，且天然带审计（消息记录在 chat 历史里）。本篇按&quot;slash command 语法 + 命令解析 + persona 权限校验 + 异常处理 + audit log&quot;五块讲清。三个高频典型场景：<code>/deploy &lt;env&gt;</code> 触发 CI、<code>/status &lt;service&gt;</code> 拉 dashboard、<code>/oncall handoff</code> 切换 on-call persona。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  USR[&quot;用户在 IM 发 /deploy staging&quot;] --&gt; ADP[&quot;chat adapter&quot;]&#10;  ADP --&gt; RT[&quot;router 5 级 lookup&quot;]&#10;  RT --&gt; CMD[&quot;命令解析器&quot;]&#10;  CMD --&gt; PERM[&quot;persona 权限校验&quot;]&#10;  PERM -- ok --&gt; EX[&quot;执行 CI hook&quot;]&#10;  PERM -- deny --&gt; NTF[&quot;回复 拒绝原因&quot;]&#10;  EX --&gt; AUD[&quot;audit log&quot;]&#10;  EX --&gt; REP[&quot;回复执行结果&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  USR[\"用户在 IM 发 /deploy staging\"] --&gt; ADP[\"chat adapter\"]\n  ADP --&gt; RT[\"router 5 级 lookup\"]\n  RT --&gt; CMD[\"命令解析器\"]\n  CMD --&gt; PERM[\"persona 权限校验\"]\n  PERM -- ok --&gt; EX[\"执行 CI hook\"]\n  PERM -- deny --&gt; NTF[\"回复 拒绝原因\"]\n  EX --&gt; AUD[\"audit log\"]\n  EX --&gt; REP[\"回复执行结果\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令模式</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态查询</td>\n<td><code>/status prod</code>、<code>/health</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发 CI/CD</td>\n<td><code>/deploy staging</code>、<code>/rollback</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persona/状态切换</td>\n<td><code>/oncall handoff</code></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识库 / memory 操作</td>\n<td><code>/recall yesterday</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧急操作</td>\n<td><code>/lock-prod</code>、<code>/quarantine</code></td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"slash-command-语法\">Slash command 语法</h2><p>OpenClaw 沿用业界惯例的 slash command 风格：<code>/&lt;cmd&gt; [&lt;positional&gt; ...] [--flag value]</code>。命令本身用斜杠开头是为了区分自然语言对话——agent 看到 <code>/</code> 前缀知道走结构化解析路径而不是 LLM 自由理解。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"/deploy staging --service api-gateway --version v2.3.1&#10;/status prod --service api-gateway&#10;/oncall handoff --to alice@example.com&#10;/recall yesterday --range &quot;9:00-12:00&quot;&#10;/lock-prod --confirm-totp 123456\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/deploy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> staging</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-gateway</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2.3.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-gateway</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/oncall</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> handoff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice@example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/recall</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yesterday</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --range</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"9:00-12:00\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/lock-prod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --confirm-totp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 123456</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法元素</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>解析为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>/&lt;cmd&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>/deploy</code></td>\n<td>命令名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置参数</td>\n<td><code>staging</code></td>\n<td>按顺序绑定到 arg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--flag val</code></td>\n<td><code>--service api</code></td>\n<td>关键字参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--confirm-totp</code></td>\n<td>TOTP 码</td>\n<td>临时高敏感 confirm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LLM 自由理解的版本（&quot;帮我部署 staging&quot;）也能跑通，但要经过 NL → 结构化命令的二次转换——slash command 是 fast path，自然语言是 slow path。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命令解析器\">命令解析器</h2><p>解析器输入是 <code>Message.text</code>，输出是结构化 <code>Command</code> 对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@dataclass&#10;class Command:&#10;    name: str&#10;    args: list[str]&#10;    flags: dict[str, str]&#10;    raw_text: str&#10;    sender_id: str&#10;    channel_id: str&#10;&#10;def parse(text: str) -&gt; Command | None:&#10;    if not text.startswith(&quot;/&quot;):&#10;        return None&#10;    tokens = shlex.split(text[1:])&#10;    name, rest = tokens[0], tokens[1:]&#10;    args, flags = [], {}&#10;    i = 0&#10;    while i &lt; len(rest):&#10;        if rest[i].startswith(&quot;--&quot;):&#10;            key = rest[i][2:]&#10;            val = rest[i+1] if i+1 &lt; len(rest) and not rest[i+1].startswith(&quot;--&quot;) else &quot;true&quot;&#10;            flags[key] = val&#10;            i += 2&#10;        else:&#10;            args.append(rest[i])&#10;            i += 1&#10;    return Command(name=name, args=args, flags=flags, raw_text=text, ...)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    args: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    flags: dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    raw_text: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sender_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channel_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> Command </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text.startswith(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shlex.split(text[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name, rest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], tokens[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    args, flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rest):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rest[i].startswith(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"--\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rest[i][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rest[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rest) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rest[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].startswith(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"--\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            flags[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            args.append(rest[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Command(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">flags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">flags, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">raw_text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>shlex.split</code> 是关键——它正确处理引号、转义、空格，避免 <code>--message &quot;hello world&quot;</code> 被错误分割。后续命令注册表按 <code>name</code> 路由到 handler。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命令注册表\">命令注册表</h2><p>Personal-agent 在启动时把&quot;哪些命令存在 / 谁能用&quot;扫描进注册表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ~/.openclaw/commands.yaml&#10;commands:&#10;  - name: deploy&#10;    handler: &#39;ci.deploy&#39;&#10;    args:&#10;      - name: env&#10;        choices: [&#39;staging&#39;, &#39;prod&#39;]&#10;        required: true&#10;    flags:&#10;      service: { type: &#39;string&#39;, required: true }&#10;      version: { type: &#39;string&#39;, default: &#39;latest&#39; }&#10;    persona_allow: [&#39;work_focus&#39;, &#39;oncall&#39;]&#10;    risk: &#39;high&#39;&#10;    require_confirm_if: &#39;env == &quot;prod&quot;&#39;&#10;&#10;  - name: status&#10;    handler: &#39;observability.status&#39;&#10;    args:&#10;      - name: env&#10;        choices: [&#39;staging&#39;, &#39;prod&#39;]&#10;    persona_allow: [&#39;*&#39;]&#10;    risk: &#39;low&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.openclaw/commands.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">commands</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deploy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ci.deploy'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        choices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'staging'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    flags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'latest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona_allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'work_focus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'oncall'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    risk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    require_confirm_if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'env == \"prod\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'observability.status'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        choices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'staging'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona_allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    risk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>args</code> / <code>flags</code></td>\n<td>类型约束 + choices 枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>persona_allow</code></td>\n<td>哪些 persona 可使用此命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>risk</code></td>\n<td>决定 audit 详细度 + 是否需 confirm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>require_confirm_if</code></td>\n<td>条件表达式触发 confirm 流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注册表也是 SoT——admin 改 yaml 后 reload 立即生效，未注册命令一律 reject（防止 typo 触发未预期 action）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"persona-权限校验\">Persona 权限校验</h2><p><code>persona_allow</code> 列表决定哪个 persona 能跑该命令——这是 IM 触发自动化的核心防护：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  CMD[&quot;命令解析完成&quot;] --&gt; SP[&quot;sender 当前 persona&quot;]&#10;  SP --&gt; CHK[&quot;sender persona ∈ persona_allow?&quot;]&#10;  CHK -- yes --&gt; RISK[&quot;risk 等级判断&quot;]&#10;  CHK -- no --&gt; DENY[&quot;回复 拒绝 + audit&quot;]&#10;  RISK -- low --&gt; RUN[&quot;直接执行&quot;]&#10;  RISK -- high/critical --&gt; CFM[&quot;push confirm&quot;]&#10;  CFM -- accept --&gt; RUN&#10;  CFM -- deny/timeout --&gt; ABORT[&quot;abort + audit&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  CMD[\"命令解析完成\"] --&gt; SP[\"sender 当前 persona\"]\n  SP --&gt; CHK[\"sender persona ∈ persona_allow?\"]\n  CHK -- yes --&gt; RISK[\"risk 等级判断\"]\n  CHK -- no --&gt; DENY[\"回复 拒绝 + audit\"]\n  RISK -- low --&gt; RUN[\"直接执行\"]\n  RISK -- high/critical --&gt; CFM[\"push confirm\"]\n  CFM -- accept --&gt; RUN\n  CFM -- deny/timeout --&gt; ABORT[\"abort + audit\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>sender 当前 persona</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>work_focus</code></td>\n<td><code>/deploy staging</code></td>\n<td>allow + 直接执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>work_focus</code></td>\n<td><code>/deploy prod</code></td>\n<td>allow + 要求 TOTP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hobby_writing</code></td>\n<td><code>/deploy staging</code></td>\n<td>deny（不在 allow 列表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>oncall</code></td>\n<td><code>/lock-prod</code></td>\n<td>allow + TOTP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意&quot;sender 当前 persona&quot;由路由 5 级 lookup 决定——同一用户在不同 channel / 时段下当前 persona 不同。这是 IM 触发自动化与 cron 的根本区别：cron 自带 persona 配置，IM 触发的 persona 由路由动态决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个典型场景\">三个典型场景</h2><h3 id=\"场景一-deploy-staging\">场景一：<code>/deploy staging</code></h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[work_chat] 用户: /deploy staging --service api-gateway&#10;[bot]      正在调用 CI（job_id: build-12345）...&#10;           20s 后:&#10;[bot]      Deploy staging api-gateway v2.3.1 完成 ✓&#10;           Dashboard: https://ci.example.com/jobs/12345\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[work_chat] 用户: /deploy staging --service api-gateway</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[bot]      正在调用 CI（job_id: build-12345）...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           20s 后:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[bot]      Deploy staging api-gateway v2.3.1 完成 ✓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           Dashboard: https://ci.example.com/jobs/12345</span></span></code></pre></div><p>幕后：persona work_focus → command deploy + env=staging → risk=high but env != &quot;prod&quot; → 不需 confirm → 调 CI webhook → 等结果 → 投回 chat。</p>\n<h3 id=\"场景二-status-prod\">场景二：<code>/status prod</code></h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[any_chat] 用户: /status prod&#10;[bot]      Prod 服务状态（拉自 grafana）：&#10;           - api-gateway:   healthy, p95=42ms, rps=1.2k&#10;           - search:        healthy, p95=130ms, rps=300&#10;           - billing:       degraded, error_rate=2%, alarms=1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[any_chat] 用户: /status prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[bot]      Prod 服务状态（拉自 grafana）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           - api-gateway:   healthy, p95=42ms, rps=1.2k</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           - search:        healthy, p95=130ms, rps=300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           - billing:       degraded, error_rate=2%, alarms=1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>低风险查询命令 persona_allow 配 <code>*</code>——任何 persona 都可查询。结果直接 fetch + 格式化回复，不走 confirm。</p>\n<h3 id=\"场景三-oncall-handoff-to-alice\">场景三：<code>/oncall handoff --to alice</code></h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[oncall_chat] 用户: /oncall handoff --to alice@example.com&#10;[bot]         正在校验 alice 接班资格 ...&#10;[bot]         alice 已确认接班 ✓&#10;              Oncall persona 已绑定到 alice 的飞书 DM&#10;              Audit: handoff_event_id=h-7821\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[oncall_chat] 用户: /oncall handoff --to alice@example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[bot]         正在校验 alice 接班资格 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[bot]         alice 已确认接班 ✓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              Oncall persona 已绑定到 alice 的飞书 DM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              Audit: handoff_event_id=h-7821</span></span></code></pre></div><p>oncall handoff 是 persona-switching 操作——需要 alice push confirm。confirm 成功后路由规则原子更新（<code>oncall</code> persona 绑定从旧 sender 切到 alice），新 alerts 自动路由到 alice。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常处理\">异常处理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类别</th>\n<th>agent 回复</th>\n<th>后续动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命令未识别</td>\n<td><code>Unknown command: /xxx</code></td>\n<td>列出近似命令建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数缺失</td>\n<td><code>Missing required arg: env</code></td>\n<td>提示完整 usage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数类型错误</td>\n<td><code>env must be staging or prod</code></td>\n<td>提示 choices</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persona 拒绝</td>\n<td><code>Permission denied for persona X</code></td>\n<td>audit log</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行超时</td>\n<td><code>Timed out after 60s</code></td>\n<td>投后续 status 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行失败</td>\n<td><code>Failed: &lt;error from upstream&gt;</code></td>\n<td>含 trace_id 便于排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>confirm 超时</td>\n<td><code>Confirm timeout, command aborted</code></td>\n<td>audit log</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>所有异常都走相同格式：简短 + 可操作。CI 调用失败时回复必须含 <code>trace_id</code> 或 job_id，让用户能跳到 dashboard 查根因——不是&quot;failed, please retry&quot;这种无信息回复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"audit-log\">Audit log</h2><p>每一条 IM 触发命令都写 audit log——这是 IM 触发自动化最大的安全优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event_id&quot;: &quot;im-cmd-9821&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ts&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T15:42:33Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sender&quot;: &quot;u-12345&quot;,&#10;  &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;work_focus&quot;,&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;lark_oc_deploy&quot;,&#10;  &quot;command&quot;: &quot;deploy staging --service api-gateway&quot;,&#10;  &quot;decision&quot;: &quot;allow&quot;,&#10;  &quot;confirm&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;execution&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;started_at&quot;: &quot;2026-05-14T15:42:34Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;duration_ms&quot;: 20100,&#10;    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;success&quot;,&#10;    &quot;downstream_id&quot;: &quot;ci-build-12345&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"im-cmd-9821\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T15:42:33Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sender\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u-12345\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"work_focus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark_oc_deploy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deploy staging --service api-gateway\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"allow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"confirm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"execution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"started_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-05-14T15:42:34Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"duration_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"success\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"downstream_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ci-build-12345\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>audit log 存到 <a href=\"../../modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/per-tenant-key-and-audit\"><code>../../2_modules-deep/5_multi-tenant-personas/3_per-tenant-key-and-audit.md</code></a> 讲的 per-tenant audit store——按 persona 分库 + 加密，admin 可按 sender / command / 时间范围 query。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>命令前缀冲突</strong>：<code>/deploy</code> 在两套不同 personas catalog 注册不同 handler。注册表必须 namespaced 或全局唯一。</li>\n<li><strong>shlex 处理 emoji</strong>：用户可能复制带 emoji 的 message——shlex 多数版本能正确处理，但旧版有 bug。CI 单测必须覆盖含 emoji 的 message。</li>\n<li><strong>flag 值含 <code>--</code></strong>：<code>--message &quot;--help me&quot;</code> 可能被误解析为新 flag。registry 应允许显式声明 &quot;rest is positional&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>persona_allow 写 <code>*</code></strong>：低风险查询命令可以，但 <code>/deploy</code> <code>/lock-prod</code> 绝不可——所有 high-risk 命令必须显式列 allow。</li>\n<li><strong>confirm push 失败静默通过</strong>：与 home action 同理，fail-secure——push 服务挂了视为 deny。</li>\n<li><strong>回复中泄露内部 trace_id 格式</strong>：trace_id 可以暴露，但内部 IP / 主机名 / token 不应。回复模板要 redact 敏感字段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>IM 触发自动化把 slash command 接到 transform 管线——用户 <code>/deploy staging</code> 经过解析 → persona 权限校验 → 风险评估 → 可选 confirm → 执行 → audit。命令注册表是 single source of truth，未注册命令一律 reject。三类典型场景（CI/CD 触发、状态查询、persona 切换）覆盖 90% 实际使用；异常处理必须包含可操作的 trace_id；所有命令都写 audit log 进 per-tenant store。结合本章前两篇——smart-home 提供物理动作、cron 提供时间触发、IM 触发提供用户主动入口——personal-agent 把&quot;日常生活自动化&quot;做成有结构、可审计、安全可控的工程系统。下一章进入 7 种 terminal 沙箱后端。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IM 触发自动化","id":"im-触发自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Slash command 语法","id":"slash-command-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"命令解析器","id":"命令解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"命令注册表","id":"命令注册表"},{"level":2,"text":"Persona 权限校验","id":"persona-权限校验"},{"level":2,"text":"三个典型场景","id":"三个典型场景"},{"level":3,"text":"场景一：`/deploy staging`","id":"场景一-deploy-staging"},{"level":3,"text":"场景二：`/status prod`","id":"场景二-status-prod"},{"level":3,"text":"场景三：`/oncall handoff --to alice`","id":"场景三-oncall-handoff-to-alice"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处理","id":"异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Audit log","id":"audit-log"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Cron 周期任务与 hooks 协同","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/cron-and-scheduled-tasks"},"next":{"title":"七后端横向对比","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/sandboxing-backends/seven-backend-comparison"}}